riginal/dpfr83WE7W7gFOlNTNP7NVigp06.jpg"},{"id":2000524,"name":"Orféo Campanella","role":"Élève lycée","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/81S9XIXcFC90czsKxOPHOP8fFQ.jpg"},{"id":2616472,"name":"Larissa Guist","role":"Ruth"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Le cose che verranno","overview":"Nathalie insegna filosofia in un liceo di Parigi. È appassionata al suo lavoro e in particolare ama trasmettere il piacere di pensare. Sposata con due figli, si divide tra la famiglia, ex studenti e una madre molto possessiva. Un giorno, il marito di Nathalie annuncia di volerla lasciare per un'altra donna. Nathalie dovrà così reinventare la sua vita..."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Things to Come","overview":"Nathalie teaches philosophy at a high school in Paris. She is passionate about her job and particularly enjoys passing on the pleasure of thinking. Married with two children, she divides her time between her family, former students and her very possessive mother. One day, Nathalie’s husband announces he is leaving her for another woman. With freedom thrust upon her, Nathalie must reinvent her life."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Nathalie est professeure de philosophie dans un lycée parisien. Passionnée par son travail, elle aime par-dessus tout transmettre son goût de la pensée. Mariée, deux enfants, elle partage sa vie entre sa famille, ses anciens élèves et sa mère, très possessive. Un jour, son mari lui annonce qu’il part vivre avec une autre femme. Confrontée à une liberté nouvelle, elle va réinventer sa vie."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ajmOrE45YbatzvAYW1WvyFFu3KB.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7enN15KGCXEYxb10bx3EOM8h9DI.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}},"tmdb:inventory-v2:series":{"originalLanguage":"fr-FR","images":{"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yvrq